  "problem": "Some customers in a pizzeria were asked about the type of pizza they prefer between spicy pizza and vegetarian pizza. The results of the survey are summarized in the two-way frequency table below.\n\n|  | Prefers Spicy | Prefers  Vegetarian | Totals |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Children | $10$ | $22$ | $32$ |\n| Adults | $41$ | $27$ | $68$ |\n| Totals | $51$ | $49$ | $100$ |\n\nEstimate the probability that a randomly chosen person is an adult or prefers spicy pizza (or both).",
